 [IMG-4]\n\n【5】嘉兴银行信息系统上线投产流程\n根据《嘉兴银行信息系统上线投产管理办法》的规定，结合\n实际工作情况，制定本流程。\n\n- Visual Type: Flowchart  \n- Title: None (no explicit title provided)  \n- Axes / Legends / Labels:  \n  - Rectangular boxes (process steps):  \n    - 上线投产  \n    - 项目经理组织相关人员进行评审  \n    - 项目经理OA提起基础环境配置需求  \n    - 运行维护中心相关人员进行配置工作  \n    - 交付基础环境  \n    - 上线部署  \n    - 投产  \n  - Diamond-shaped boxes (decision points):  \n    - 评审  \n    - 安全检测通过项目经理同意  \n    - 项目经理在OA上线投产审批  \n    - 技术和业务验证并填写验证报告  \n  - Arrow labels (branch outcomes):  \n    - 不通过 (appears on branches from “评审”, “安全检测通过项目经理同意”, “项目经理在OA上线投产审批”, “技术和业务验证并填写验证报告”)  \n    - 通过 (appears on branches from “评审”, “安全检测通过项目经理同意”, “项目经理在OA上线投产审批”, “技术和业务验证并填写验证报告”)  \n    - 整改完成 (arrow label from “按相关要求进行整改” back to “项目经理在OA上线投产审批”)  \n- Data Points: None (the visual represents a process flow, not quantitative data)  \n- Trends / Insights: The flowchart depicts a structured, iterative process for “上线投产” (going live/launching). Key features include:  \n  - Multiple review and approval stages (e.g., initial project team review, OA-based manager approval, security testing, technical/business validation).  \n  - Iterative correction loops (e.g., if “评审” or “安全检测” fails, the process reverts to earlier steps; if “项目经理在OA上线投产审批” fails, it triggers整改 (correction)).  \n  - Sequential dependencies (e.g., environment configuration must precede deployment, and validation must succeed before final “投产”).  \n- Captions / Annotations: None (all relevant information is embedded in the flowchart’s labels and structure)一、整体流程：\n上线投产\n交付基础环境\n整改完成\n项目经理组织相关\n按相关要求\n人员进行评审\n不通过\nOA上线投产审批\n进行整改\n通过\n评审\n上线部署\n不通过\n项目经理OA提起基\n础环境配置需求\n技术和业务验证\n并填写验证报告\n通过\n通过\n运行维护中心相关\n人员进行配置工作\n投产\n项目经理同意\n   📄 来源: 嘉兴银行信息系统上线投产流程 v1.0.pdf ([⬇️ 下载](/api/v1/assets/proxy/ragflow/doc/b5556598e93611f08e41712b5dc403b8?name=%E5%98%89%E5%85%B4%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%BF%E6%8A%95%E4%BA%A7%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%20v1.0.pdf)) | 相关度: 37.21%\n   相关图片: [IMG-5]\n\n【6】五、OA审批流程：基础环境OA审批流程\n\n- Visual Type: Flowchart  \n- Title: None  \n- Axes / Legends / Labels: All labels are the text within each node (rectangular or rounded rectangular boxes): "申请人提出", "开发中心分管负责人", "运行维护中心分管负责人", "操作系统管理人员", "中间件管理人员", "数据库管理人员", "网络管理人员", "科技管理中心安全管理人员", "科技运行维护分管负责人", "项目经理确认", "申请人办结". No axes or legends are present.  \n- Data Points: The flowchart depicts a sequential process with the following steps and connections:  \n  1. Start: 申请人提出 (Applicant submits request)  \n  2. Next: 开发中心分管负责人 (Development Center Manager)  \n  3. Next: 运行维护中心分管负责人 (Operation and Maintenance Center Manager)  \n  4. Parallel steps from 运行维护中心分管负责人:  \n     - Left: 操作系统管理人员 (Operating System Manager)  \n     - Middle-left: 中间件管理人员 (Middleware Manager)  \n     - Middle-right: 数据库管理人员 (Database Manager)  \n     - Right: 网络管理人员 (Network Manager)  \n  5. Next: 科技管理中心安全管理人员 (Technology Management Center Security Manager)  \n  6. Next: 科技运行维护分管负责人 (Technology Operation and Maintenance Manager)  \n  7. Next: 项目经理确认 (Project Manager Approval)  \n  8. End: 申请人办结 (Applicant completes the process)  \n- Trends / Insights: The flowchart illustrates a hierarchical, multi-stage workflow with both linear and parallel components. Key insights include:  \n  - Linear progression from applicant submission through managerial and specialist roles.  \n  - Parallel processing at the 运行维护中心分管负责人 stage, where four technical teams (OS, middleware, database, network) handle tasks concurrently.  \n  - Consolidation of parallel tasks into a security review (科技管理中心安全管理人员) before advancing to subsequent approvals.  \n  - Final approval by the project manager concludes the process for the applicant.  \n- Captions / Annotations: No captions or annotations are present beyond the node labels.申请人提出\n开发中心分管负责\n人\n运行维护中心分管\n负责人\n操作系统管理人员\n中间件管理人员\n数据库管理人员\n网络管理人员\n科技管理中心安全\n管理人员\n科技运行维护分管\n负责人\n项目经理确认\n申请人办结\n*申请人办结后，需存PDF电子稿并打印后归入项目文档；\n*流程附件为评审报告（扫描件）\n   📄 来源: 嘉兴银行信息系统上线投产流程 v