9%E5%85%B4%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%BF%E6%8A%95%E4%BA%A7%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%20v1.0.pdf)) | 相关度: 25.92%\n   相关图片: [IMG-8]\n\n【9】五、OA审批流程：基础环境OA审批流程\n\n- Visual Type: Flowchart  \n- Title: None  \n- Axes / Legends / Labels: All labels are the text within each node (rectangular or rounded rectangular boxes): "申请人提出", "开发中心分管负责人", "运行维护中心分管负责人", "操作系统管理人员", "中间件管理人员", "数据库管理人员", "网络管理人员", "科技管理中心安全管理人员", "科技运行维护分管负责人", "项目经理确认", "申请人办结". No axes or legends are present.  \n- Data Points: The flowchart depicts a sequential process with the following steps and connections:  \n  1. Start: 申请人提出 (Applicant submits request)  \n  2. Next: 开发中心分管负责人 (Development Center Manager)  \n  3. Next: 运行维护中心分管负责人 (Operation and Maintenance Center Manager)  \n  4. Parallel steps from 运行维护中心分管负责人:  \n     - Left: 操作系统管理人员 (Operating System Manager)  \n     - Middle-left: 中间件管理人员 (Middleware Manager)  \n     - Middle-right: 数据库管理人员 (Database Manager)  \n     - Right: 网络管理人员 (Network Manager)  \n  5. Next: 科技管理中心安全管理人员 (Technology Management Center Security Manager)  \n  6. Next: 科技运行维护分管负责人 (Technology Operation and Maintenance Manager)  \n  7. Next: 项目经理确认 (Project Manager Approval)  \n  8. End: 申请人办结 (Applicant completes the process)  \n- Trends / Insights: The flowchart illustrates a hierarchical, multi-stage workflow with both linear and parallel components. Key insights include:  \n  - Linear progression from applicant submission through managerial and specialist roles.  \n  - Parallel processing at the 运行维护中心分管负责人 stage, where four technical teams (OS, middleware, database, network) handle tasks concurrently.  \n  - Consolidation of parallel tasks into a security review (科技管理中心安全管理人员) before advancing to subsequent approvals.  \n  - Final approval by the project manager concludes the process for the applicant.  \n- Captions / Annotations: No captions or annotations are present beyond the node labels.申请人提出\n开发中心分管负责\n人\n运行维护中心分管\n负责人\n操作系统管理人员